<https://natclinn.github.io/NatclinnTbox> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "Le projet NATCLâ€™INN vise Ã  aider les entreprises agroalimentaires Ã  mieux rÃ©pondre aux attentes de naturalitÃ© des consommateurs, perÃ§ue comme gage de qualitÃ©, de santÃ© et de goÃ»t. En sâ€™appuyant sur la caractÃ©risation des reprÃ©sentations de la naturalitÃ© et lâ€™identification de marqueurs pertinents, il dÃ©veloppe un outil dâ€™arbitrage multicritÃ¨re intÃ©grant contraintes techniques, Ã©conomiques et rÃ©glementaires. PortÃ© par lâ€™ADRIA, lâ€™UBO-LEGO, lâ€™INRAE et plusieurs partenaires industriels, ce projet collaboratif est labellisÃ© par Valorial."@fr .
<https://natclinn.github.io/NatclinnTbox> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "The NATCLâ€™INN project aims to help agri-food companies better meet consumers' expectations for naturalness, which is perceived as a guarantee of quality, health and taste. Based on the characterisation of representations of naturalness and the identification of relevant markers, it is developing a multi-criteria arbitration tool that integrates technical, economic and regulatory constraints. Led by ADRIA, UBO-LEGO, INRAE and several industrial partners, this collaborative project has been certified by Valorial."@en .
